# Frontend build stage runs its own `npm ci` fresh inside the
# container -- copying the host's node_modules or a stale dist/ in
# would be wrong (wrong platform, possibly stale) and just bloats the
# build context for no benefit. Everything else under frontend/
# (package.json, src/, index.html, configs) IS needed by the new
# frontend build stage -- see decisions.md D-0047.
frontend/node_modules/
frontend/dist/
